.TH "DATATRANSFERITEM.GETASSTRING" "3JS" "August 31, 2026" "JavaScript" "JavaScript Reference Manual"
.SH NAME
DataTransferItem.getAsString \- DataTransferItem: getAsString() method
.SH SYNOPSIS
The \f[B]\f[CB]getAsString()\f[B]\f[R] method of the
\f[CR]DataTransferItem\f[R] interface invokes the given callback with
the drag data item\(cqs string data as the argument if the item\(cqs
\f[CR]kind\f[R] is a \f[I]Plain unicode string\f[R] (i.e.,
\f[CR]kind\f[R] is \f[CR]string\f[R]).
.PP
During a drag operation, this method can only read data in the handlers
for the \f[CR]dragstart\f[R] and \f[CR]drop\f[R] events, because those
are the only times the drag data store is readable.
Calling it from any other drag event does not invoke the callback.
The method must be called synchronously within the event handler,
although the callback runs asynchronously.
See Reading the drag data store for details.
.SH SYNTAX
.IP
.EX
getAsString(callbackFn)
.EE
.SS Parameters
.TP
\f[B]callbackFn\f[R]
A callback function that receives following arguments:
.RS
.TP
\f[B]data\f[R]
The \f[CR]DataTransferItem\f[R]\(cqs string data.
.RE
.SS Return value
None (\f[CR]undefined\f[R]).
.SH EXAMPLES
This example shows the use of the \f[CR]getAsString()\f[R] method as an
\f[I]inline function\f[R] in a \f[CR]drop\f[R] event handler.
.IP
.EX
\f[B]function\f[R] dropHandler(ev) {
  console.log(\(dqDrop\(dq);
  ev.preventDefault();
  \f[B]for\f[R] (\f[B]const\f[R] item \f[B]of\f[R] ev.dataTransfer.items) {
    \f[B]if\f[R] (item.kind === \(dqstring\(dq && item.type.match(\(dq\(hatext/plain\(dq)) {
      \f[I]// This item is the target node\f[R]
      item.getAsString((s) \f[B]=>\f[R] {
        ev.target.appendChild(document.getElementById(s));
      });
    } \f[B]else\f[R] \f[B]if\f[R] (item.kind === \(dqstring\(dq && item.type.match(\(dq\(hatext/html\(dq)) {
      \f[I]// Drag data item is HTML\f[R]
      console.log(\(dq\&... Drop: HTML\(dq);
    } \f[B]else\f[R] \f[B]if\f[R] (item.kind === \(dqstring\(dq && item.type.match(\(dq\(hatext/uri\-list\(dq)) {
      \f[I]// Drag data item is URI\f[R]
      console.log(\(dq\&... Drop: URI\(dq);
    } \f[B]else\f[R] \f[B]if\f[R] (item.kind === \(dqfile\(dq && item.type.match(\(dq\(haimage/\(dq)) {
      \f[I]// Drag data item is an image file\f[R]
      \f[B]const\f[R] f = item.getAsFile();
      console.log(\(dq\&... Drop: File\(dq);
    }
  }
}
.EE
